WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: fr

00:00:01.502 --> 00:00:05.606 size:53% position:73% line:53%
(brouhaha)

00:00:04.572 --> 00:00:06.373 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- C'est la plus ancienne

00:00:05.106 --> 00:00:09.710 size:53% position:73% line:53%
école primaire et secondaire

00:00:05.706 --> 00:00:10.744 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de Kaboul.

00:00:06.473 --> 00:00:11.779 size:53% position:73% line:53%
(récitation)

00:00:09.810 --> 00:00:12.746 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Le lycée Malalaï a vu défiler,

00:00:10.845 --> 00:00:13.647 size:53% position:73% line:53%
au cours du siècle dernier,

00:00:11.879 --> 00:00:16.049 size:53% position:73% line:53%
des élèves qui allaient,

00:00:12.847 --> 00:00:17.718 size:53% position:73% line:53%
pour certains, former

00:00:13.748 --> 00:00:19.854 size:53% position:73% line:53%
l'élite de la société afghane.

00:00:16.150 --> 00:00:21.188 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Bonjour, les élèves!

00:00:17.818 --> 00:00:22.056 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- (élèves): Bonjour, Madame!

00:00:19.954 --> 00:00:22.723 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Dans cette classe de 6e année,

00:00:21.288 --> 00:00:24.692 size:53% position:73% line:53%
des filles de 10 à 14 ans

00:00:22.156 --> 00:00:26.460 size:53% position:73% line:53%
apprennent les rudiments

00:00:22.823 --> 00:00:29.096 size:53% position:73% line:53%
du français.

00:00:24.792 --> 00:00:29.830 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- L'après-midi...

00:00:26.560 --> 00:00:30.698 size:53% position:73% line:53%
(indistinct)

00:00:29.196 --> 00:00:32.399 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- La professeure fait

00:00:29.930 --> 00:00:33.734 size:53% position:73% line:53%
quelques fautes, mais on peut

00:00:30.798 --> 00:00:34.335 size:53% position:73% line:53%
difficilement lui en vouloir.

00:00:32.499 --> 00:00:36.103 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- "Ma" cheveu est court.

00:00:33.834 --> 00:00:36.804 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- (élèves): "Ma" cheveu

00:00:34.435 --> 00:00:38.005 size:53% position:73% line:53%
est court.

00:00:36.203 --> 00:00:39.573 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- C'est que Hassina n'a

00:00:36.904 --> 00:00:40.674 size:53% position:73% line:53%
que 16 ans et elle n'est pas

00:00:38.105 --> 00:00:41.742 size:53% position:73% line:53%
enseignante. Après la prise

00:00:39.673 --> 00:00:43.210 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de pouvoir des talibans,

00:00:40.774 --> 00:00:44.545 size:53% position:73% line:53%
le lycée a perdu tous

00:00:41.842 --> 00:00:45.479 size:53% position:73% line:53%
ses professeurs de français.

00:00:43.310 --> 00:00:46.680 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Et comme pour toutes les filles

00:00:44.645 --> 00:00:48.149 size:53% position:73% line:53%
afghanes au-delà de la 6e année,

00:00:45.579 --> 00:00:52.086 size:53% position:73% line:53%
les talibans ont décidé que

00:00:46.780 --> 00:00:52.086 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Hassina n'a plus le droit de

00:00:48.249 --> 00:00:52.086 size:53% position:73% line:53%
fréquenter les bancs d'école.

00:01:19.547 --> 00:01:22.549 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- (élèves): Les yeux marrons.

00:01:20.514 --> 00:01:24.184 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Au premier rang de la classe,

00:01:21.315 --> 00:01:25.019 size:53% position:73% line:53%
on remarque tout de suite

00:01:22.650 --> 00:01:25.820 size:53% position:73% line:53%
l'engouement de Nadia et Hadia.

00:01:24.285 --> 00:01:27.288 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Tour à tour, elles lèvent

00:01:25.119 --> 00:01:29.590 size:53% position:73% line:53%
la main bien haut pour

00:01:25.920 --> 00:01:30.558 size:53% position:73% line:53%
prendre part aux exercices.

00:01:27.388 --> 00:01:31.558 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Euh... oui.

00:01:29.690 --> 00:01:32.226 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- (professeure): Vanne.

00:01:30.658 --> 00:01:35.162 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Vanne.

00:01:31.659 --> 00:01:35.162 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Elles n'ont pas l'intention de

00:01:32.326 --> 00:01:35.162 size:53% position:73% line:53%
s'effacer derrire les garçons.

00:01:57.618 --> 00:02:03.357 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- L'une rêve de devenir juge;

00:01:58.419 --> 00:02:04.158 size:53% position:73% line:53%
l'autre veut être médecin.

00:02:02.223 --> 00:02:04.959 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Merci, bravo!

00:02:03.457 --> 00:02:05.793 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Une aspiration noble

00:02:04.258 --> 00:02:06.627 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de servir son pays.

00:02:05.059 --> 00:02:13.400 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Mais l'an prochain,

00:02:05.893 --> 00:02:14.201 size:53% position:73% line:53%
elles seront trop grandes

00:02:06.727 --> 00:02:15.035 size:53% position:73% line:53%
pour rester à l'école.

00:02:13.500 --> 00:02:38.692 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Pour Raihana, l'exclusion

00:02:14.301 --> 00:02:38.692 size:53% position:73% line:53%
forcée des salles de classe

00:02:15.135 --> 00:02:38.692 size:53% position:73% line:53%
est une double punition.

00:02:45.699 --> 00:02:48.035 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Elle n'ose même plus

00:02:46.500 --> 00:02:49.403 size:53% position:73% line:53%
jouer ses morceaux favoris

00:02:47.301 --> 00:02:49.403 size:53% position:73% line:53%
sur le clavier qu'elle a

00:02:48.168 --> 00:02:49.403 size:53% position:73% line:53%
à la maison.

00:02:59.747 --> 00:03:02.883 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Dunya, sa copine, se sent
elle aussi réduite au silence.

00:03:24.171 --> 00:03:26.707 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Cette douleur dont elle parle,

00:03:24.972 --> 00:03:27.541 size:53% position:73% line:53%
elle a été décuplée depuis

00:03:25.806 --> 00:03:31.211 size:53% position:73% line:53%
l'arrivée au pouvoir des

00:03:26.807 --> 00:03:31.211 size:53% position:73% line:53%
talibans. Mais Raihana insiste,

00:03:27.641 --> 00:03:31.211 size:53% position:73% line:53%
ce n'est pas de la peur.

00:04:15.589 --> 00:04:17.925 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Des paroles assumées,

00:04:16.356 --> 00:04:18.759 size:53% position:73% line:53%
répétées comme un mantra

00:04:17.191 --> 00:04:19.793 size:53% position:73% line:53%
auquel s'accrocher et qui

00:04:18.025 --> 00:04:20.594 size:53% position:73% line:53%
rendent Jholyia très fière.

00:04:18.859 --> 00:04:21.462 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Cette enseignante féministe

00:04:19.893 --> 00:04:22.129 size:53% position:73% line:53%
cumulait deux postes à temps

00:04:20.694 --> 00:04:26.800 size:53% position:73% line:53%
complet pour subvenir

00:04:21.562 --> 00:04:26.800 size:53% position:73% line:53%
aux besoins de sa famille;

00:04:22.229 --> 00:04:26.800 size:53% position:73% line:53%
deux emplois qu'elle a perdus.

00:04:50.391 --> 00:04:52.760 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Ces droits pour lesquels

00:04:51.191 --> 00:04:53.594 size:53% position:73% line:53%
elle veut continuer de se

00:04:52.026 --> 00:04:54.428 size:53% position:73% line:53%
battre, ils ont été durement

00:04:52.860 --> 00:04:55.262 size:53% position:73% line:53%
acquis par les femmes au cours

00:04:53.694 --> 00:04:56.063 size:53% position:73% line:53%
des 20 dernières années par

00:04:54.528 --> 00:04:56.897 size:53% position:73% line:53%
le biais d'une multitude

00:04:55.362 --> 00:04:57.731 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de programmes d'aide

00:04:56.163 --> 00:04:58.565 size:53% position:73% line:53%
au développement financés par

00:04:56.997 --> 00:04:59.400 size:53% position:73% line:53%
la communauté internationale.

00:04:57.831 --> 00:05:00.234 size:53% position:73% line:53%
C'était l'ultime priorité

00:04:58.665 --> 00:05:01.034 size:53% position:73% line:53%
du Canada, mais comme

00:04:59.500 --> 00:05:01.869 size:53% position:73% line:53%
les emplois de Jholya,

00:05:00.334 --> 00:05:02.703 size:53% position:73% line:53%
ces programmes disparaissent

00:05:01.135 --> 00:05:03.504 size:53% position:73% line:53%
avec l'arrivée de talibans.

00:05:01.969 --> 00:05:04.338 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Il y a une semaine déjà,

00:05:02.803 --> 00:05:05.172 size:53% position:73% line:53%
les talibans continuaient

00:05:03.637 --> 00:05:09.776 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de dire que les filles plus

00:05:04.471 --> 00:05:10.544 size:53% position:73% line:53%
âgées pourraient retourner

00:05:05.305 --> 00:05:11.412 size:53% position:73% line:53%
à l'école... bientôt.

00:05:09.877 --> 00:05:12.212 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Il faut d'abord pouvoir

00:05:10.644 --> 00:05:17.718 size:53% position:73% line:53%
assurer leur sécurité et

00:05:11.512 --> 00:05:18.552 size:53% position:73% line:53%
mettre en place une ségrégation

00:05:12.312 --> 00:05:19.386 size:53% position:73% line:53%
des sexes absolue.

00:05:17.818 --> 00:05:22.489 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Au lycée Malalaï, la directrice

00:05:18.652 --> 00:05:22.489 size:53% position:73% line:53%
reste confiante que les talibans

00:05:19.486 --> 00:05:22.489 size:53% position:73% line:53%
respecteront leur parole.

00:05:39.873 --> 00:05:43.944 size:53% position:73% line:53%
(chant)

00:05:42.409 --> 00:05:44.778 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 L'espoir, c'est un mot

00:05:43.210 --> 00:05:45.312 size:53% position:73% line:53%
qu'on prononce très peu

00:05:44.044 --> 00:05:45.312 size:53% position:73% line:53%
en Afghanistan, sauf pour dire

00:05:44.878 --> 00:05:45.312 size:53% position:73% line:53%
qu'il n'en reste presque plu

